      "cities": {
        "baku": "Keep Gobustan as a day trip from Baku. If the mountains are a priority, spend a night or two near Shahdag instead of doing a second long out-and-back.",
        "tbilisi": "If the Georgian Military Highway is open, one night in Stepantsminda gives the mountains more time. Keep the city or Kakheti plan if the road or forecast is poor.",
        "budapest": "Keep the Budapest stay and take the H5 to Szentendre for the day. Spend a night there if you want evening time by the river and a second museum visit.",
        "vienna": "Take a Bratislava day trip for an easy return. Consider one night if you want the markets after dark and a guided walk or castle visit the next morning.",
        "prague": "With five Prague nights, a day in Kutn\u00e1 Hora is the simplest choice. Stay one night if you want separate visits to the historic centre and Sedlec."
